'''J.K. Bun Bun''' (赤井ブン太郎, ''Akai Buntarō'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

